<item>
            <title>[IGNITE-9646] Regression in release build for ignite-aws module</title>
                <link>https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/IGNITE-9646</link>
                <project id="12315922" key="IGNITE">Ignite</project>
                    <description>&lt;p&gt;In &lt;a href=&quot;https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/IGNITE-9073&quot; title=&quot;Ignite modules should use jackson2 dependency rater then jackson1&quot; class=&quot;issue-link&quot; data-issue-key=&quot;IGNITE-9073&quot;&gt;&lt;del&gt;IGNITE-9073&lt;/del&gt;&lt;/a&gt; from pom.xml of&#160;ignite-aws jackson-core-asl &amp;amp;&#160;jackson-mapper-asl&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;were removed and that leads to ClassNotFound errors at runtime if&#160;ignite node&#160;uses&#160; TcpDiscoveryS3IpFinder and started from binary build.&#160;&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;We need to return that dependencies back, because Ignite binary build logic&#160;ignore transient dependencies.&lt;/p&gt;</description>
                <environment></environment>
        <key id="13186041">IGNITE-9646</key>
            <summary>Regression in release build for ignite-aws module</summary>
